    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2438$13 - 2025 uehs ui 27 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2025'05'27No. 2438/13 - TUESDAY, MAY 27, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nNotice under Section 76A\n\nWHEREAS the Local Authorities Elections have been concluded and the results released, it is required that each party or group shall, without delay, notify the Election Commission of the names of the members to be elected to that party or group, including the women members, however, although 21 days have now passed since the conclusion of the election, the prescribed number of members to be elected has not yet been nominated and submitted to the Election Commission:\n\nWhereas, by virtue of the Gazette Noti\ufb01 cation No. 2424/02 dated 17.02.2025, issued by the Minister in charge of Public Administration, Provincial Councils and Local Government, it has been ordered that the term of o\ufb03 ce of the Local Authorities shall commence on 02.06.2025:\n\nAnd whereas, in compliance with the directions of the Minister, the names of all elected and nominated members shall be published in the Gazette prior to the commencement of the term of o\ufb03 ce, and therefore each party and group is hereby directed to submit the names of all such members to the Returning O\ufb03 cer of the relevant Local Authority on or before midnight (12:00 a.m.) on 30.05.2025. R.M.A.L. R\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d84\u0d7e, M.A.P.C. P\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a, A\u0d86\u0d7e\u0d7e\u0d8b F\u0d7a\u0d7a\u0d82\u0d93, Chairman, Member, Member, Election Commission. Election Commission. Election Commission.\n\nA. S\u0d81\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d86\u0d8e\u0d80\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a\u0d87, Prof. L\u0d7a\u0d84\u0d8c\u0d81\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d87 D\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d8c\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d92\u0d7a\u0d84\u0d7e, Member, Member, Election Commission. Election Commission.\n\nO\ufb03 ce of the Election Commission,Sarana Mawatha,Rajagiriya,On this 27th day of May, 2025.\n\nEOG 05 - 0181"
