    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2438$12 - 2025 uehs ui 27 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2025.05.27No. 2438/12 - Tuesday, MAY 27, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nL.D.B. 6/2008bank of ceylon ordinance (Chapter 397)\n\norder under Sub-section (2) of Section 7\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under paragraph 3 of Article 44 of the Constitution of Sri Lanka read with subsection (2) of Section 7 of the Bank of Ceylon Ordinance (Chapter 397), I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this Order determine that the paid-up capital of the Bank of Ceylon be increased from Rupees Twenty-Five Thousand Million (Rs. 25,000,000,000) to Rupees Twenty-Five Thousand and Seven Hundred and Thirty Million. (Rs. 25,730,000,000).\n\nAnura Kumara Dissanayake, President. Colombo,May 27, 2025.\n\nEOG 05 - 0184\n\n1A- G 44437 - 05 (05/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk"
